\newlabel{fig:era}{{3}{7}{ERA $\lambda $ sweep: validation PPL as a function of $\lambda $. All $\lambda > 0$ improve over baseline. Optimal $\lambda =0.05$. The U-shaped curve suggests an optimal attention concentration level.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
